WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.040
Next, we talk about different kinds of hard or sad things other students have gone through.

00:00:05.040 --> 00:00:08.720
Click on each type to see if something like that has happened to you.

00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:11.439
You can say yes without telling anyone what happened.

00:00:11.439 --> 00:00:15.599
Later, we will share some tips to help you feel better if you've had hard times like

00:00:15.599 --> 00:00:16.080
these.

